flowchart TD
    A[Backlog item] --> B{Needs a plan?}
    B -- no --> I
    B -- yes --> C[Planner explores the repo, read-only]
    C --> D[Up to 5 questions with a recommended answer, up to 20 assumptions]
    D --> E[You answer on the plan card, correct assumptions, or take the defaults]
    E --> F[Planner writes plan, decisions table, PR split, review focus]
    F --> G{You approve?}
    G -- re-plan --> C
    G -- approve --> H{2 or more PRs?}
    H -- yes --> H2[Child items, one per PR, each blocked by the one before]
    H -- no --> I
    H2 --> I[Implementer builds from the plan and reports any deviation]
    I --> J[Reviewer checks the code against the decisions and the review focus]
